    "updated_at": "2026-11-14T21:49:23Z",
    "body": "Escalating from `effort:medium` to `effort:high` (not claiming).\n\nRemaining work on `upstream/main` after PR #222 and PR #969 spans 6 crates and requires `Cargo.toml` `[dependencies]` changes (which the headless worker rule forbids touching):\n- `crates/cl` (`cl/moves.rs`, `cl/path.rs`): 3 `eprintln!` calls; `crates/cl/Cargo.toml` has no `tracing` dep.\n- `crates/geometry` (`geometry/slice.rs`): 2 `eprintln!` calls; `crates/geometry/Cargo.toml` has no `tracing` dep.\n- `crates/motion` (`multiaxis/curve.rs`, `rotary.rs`, `stamp_pose.rs`, `wrap_exit.rs`): 6 `eprintln!` calls; `crates/motion/Cargo.toml` has no `tracing` dep.\n- `crates/sim` (`sim.rs`, `stock_sim/iso.rs`): 3 `eprintln!` calls; `crates/sim/Cargo.toml` has no `tracing` dep.\n- `crates/tools` (`catalog_asset.rs`): 1 `eprintln!` call; `crates/tools/Cargo.toml` has no `tracing` dep.\n- `crates/ui` (`egui_app/gpu_init.rs`, `os_quit.rs`, `shell.rs`, `shell_window.rs`, `shell_window/frame.rs`, `headless_gpu.rs`): native GPU/shell `println!`/`eprintln!` calls; `crates/ui/Cargo.toml` has no `tracing` dep.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
